      "id": "sol.ahsme-1974-p2.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The distinct numbers \\(x_1,x_2\\) are the two roots of \\[ 3x^2-hx-b=0. \\] By Vieta’s formulas, their sum is \\(-\\frac{(-h)}{3}=\\frac{h}{3}.\\)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is B.",
